# Documented operator catalog layout. The Python tools currently read
# lib/catalog_config.py; keep this file next to the media tree as the human
# description of that layout. Caches belong in <library>/.rusty-library/.

# Primary movie homes. Secondary genres appear as generated links under genres/.
# action       -> Action
# anime        -> Anime, Animation
# comedy       -> Comedy
# drama        -> Drama
# fantasy      -> Fantasy
# kids/Movies  -> Kids, Family
# sci-fi       -> Sci-Fi

# Show homes. Year/age views link the whole show directory.
# shows
# kids/Shows

# Generated views (do not hand-edit):
# genres/_genre-index.tsv
# genres/BY_YEAR/
# genres/BY_AGE/
# genres/UNTIL_AGE/
# genres/BY_RATING/

# Optional reviewed age overrides live at:
#   <library>/.rusty-library/age-overrides.tsv
# Copy age-overrides.example.tsv there and replace the sample rows.
